36
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,400
是什么让智能体AI与传统 AI不同？
What makes agentic AI different from traditional AI?

37
00:03:42,574 --> 00:03:50,320
是仅生成文本、执行固定规则、目标驱动的自主行动，还是仅由人类做决策？
Is it text generation only, fixed rule execution, goal-driven autonomous actions, human-only decisions?

38
