522
00:45:40,750 --> 00:45:49,248
现在，它将扮演质量保证工程师、用户体验设计师、无障碍专家等我们赋予的角色，并深入地
Now, again, this will act as a QA engineer UX designer accessibility specialist and whatever roles that we have given, and in depth it's going to

