00:45:49,678 --> 00:45:57,860
评估我们创建的网站，审查我们犯的所有错误，或者看看哪些地方可以做得更好。它会列出这些内容。
evaluate the website that we have created and review the entire mistakes that we have done, or can we better things necessary? It will list.

